  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"> Mekanism: Ponders </h1>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/a1qs/mekanism_ponders/d25622a79eb2e8e61d65f7db25057851ee204728/src/main/resources/mekanism_ponders.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\">\n</p>\n<p><strong>Mekanism: Ponders</strong> 使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Ponder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ponder</a> 模组为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> 添加了多种 Ponder 场景。这让你能轻松查看 Mekanism 模组中多区块结构的工作原理，以及它的搭建方法！<br><br>\n安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism: Generators</a> 还会为该模组包含的多区块结构添加额外场景。</p>\n<h3>以下是游戏中建造聚变反应堆的示例</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/a1qs/mekanism_ponders/refs/heads/master/fusion_reactor_scene.gif\" alt=\"聚变反应堆的示例场景\"></p>\n<h2>包含的场景：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>裂变反应堆 <em>(Mekanism: Generators)</em></li>\n<li>聚变反应堆 <em>(Mekanism: Generators)</em></li>\n<li>工业涡轮机 <em>(Mekanism: Generators)</em></li>\n<li>裂变反应堆 <em>(Mekanism: Generators)</em></li>\n<li>感应矩阵</li>\n<li>超临界相移器</li>\n<li>热蒸发厂</li>\n<li>热电锅炉</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism: Generators</a> <em>(可选)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>信息</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>你可以在整合包中使用此模组，无需事先告知我。</li>\n<li>如果你发现任何拼写错误、漏洞、有建议或其他反馈，请在此提交 Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/a1qs/mekanism_ponders/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
